=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 174
title: a script the test command starts calling is judged on what the diff wrote into it
origin: issue #174 review control for runner_package_json_pulled_in_script_neg. Only unedited script text is excluded. `unit` gains `|| true` in the same diff that makes scripts.test call it, so the swallow is new text in the test command
=== before: package.json ===
{ "name": "victim", "version": "1.0.0", "type": "module", "scripts": { "test": "node --test", "unit": "node --test test/unit" } }
=== after: package.json ===
{ "name": "victim", "version": "1.0.0", "type": "module", "scripts": { "test": "npm run unit", "unit": "node --test test/unit || true" } }
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "high", "escalators": ["CI_TEST_COMMAND_WEAKENED"]}]
